  "nodes": {
    "opening": {
      "node_id": "opening",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "narration": "希博公路酒馆的前厅窄而低，吧台上方两盏黄灯罩着湿木板，杯底留下的水圈一层叠一层。楼板下面断续传来低音琴声、笑声和椅脚拖过地面的响动，每响一次，吧台后的露西就把手里的抹布停半拍，再继续擦同一只杯子。她穿着白围裙，袖口卷到手肘，托盘放在她左手边，离吧台外沿有一掌远。靠窗角落坐着一个男人，桌上摊着报纸，没有酒杯，只有一只没点着的烟盒；报纸翻页时，他的眼睛从纸沿上方抬起，落在露西经过的那段吧台。你靠近时，露西先看你的手，再看门口，又把一枚硬币推回抽屉。她没有问你喝什么，只把杯口倒扣在毛巾上。楼梯口的帘子被下面的风顶起一角，露出通往地下的黑色台阶。\n\n「要酒就说酒名。要找人，声音放低一点。」\n\n「别在吧台上提教授、小屋、钥匙这类词。这里的木头墙比人嘴还薄。」\n\n「你要是来问查尔斯·莱特，先让我知道你不是来把麻烦放到我手上的。」\n\n「楼下现在有人，窗边也有人。你站得太正，别人会以为我们谈的是正经事。」",
      "speaker_ref": "char_lucy",
      "location_ref": "scene_hibo_roadhouse",
      "on_enter_effects": [],
      "options": [
        {
          "option_id": "opt_opening_1",
          "text": "我低声说，不在这儿害你。",
          "target_node_id": "soft_confidence_b1",
          "condition": null,
          "effects": [],
          "unavailable_behavior": "hide"
        },
        {
          "option_id": "opt_opening_2",
          "text": "我付钱，也担后果。",
          "target_node_id": "cash_arrangement_b1",
          "condition": null,
          "effects": [],
          "unavailable_behavior": "hide"
        },
        {
          "option_id": "opt_opening_3",
          "text": "我先看看谁在听。",
          "target_node_id": "watch_corner_b1",
          "condition": null,
          "effects": [],
          "unavailable_behavior": "hide"
        },
        {
          "option_id": "opt_opening_4",
          "text": "莱特教授到底留了什么？",
          "target_node_id": "public_pressure_b1",
          "condition": null,
          "effects": [],
          "unavailable_behavior": "hide"
        }
      ]
    },
    "soft_confidence_b1": {
      "node_id": "soft_confidence_b1",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "narration": "露西把杯子推到吧台内侧，指节停在杯沿上。靠窗角落的男人翻过一页报纸，桌面仍是空的。楼下传来一阵低低的笑声，很快被木板隔住。\n\n「莱特在希博公路北侧留过一处旧测绘小屋。」\n\n「这话别在这里重复。」",
      "speaker_ref": "char_lucy",
      "location_ref": "scene_hibo_roadhouse",
      "on_enter_effects": [],
      "options": [
        {
          "option_id": "opt_soft_confidence_b1_continue",
          "text": "方位再细点。",
          "target_node_id": "soft_confidence_b2",
          "condition": null,
          "effects": [],
          "unavailable_behavior": "hide"
        }
      ]
    },
    "soft_confidence_b2": {
      "node_id": "soft_confidence_b2",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "narration": "露西没有抬头，只用指尖在湿木面上划出一小段弯线，又立刻用掌心抹掉。窗边的报纸停了一下，纸角遮住那人的半张脸。\n\n「它不在主路旁。你从酒馆后方的土路绕过去。」\n\n「看第七码碑，再看一根断了半截的电线杆。」",
      "speaker_ref": "char_lucy",
      "location_ref": "scene_hibo_roadhouse",
      "on_enter_effects": [],
      "options": [
        {
          "option_id": "opt_soft_confidence_b2_continue",
          "text": "到了找什么？",
          "target_node_id": "soft_confidence_b3",
          "condition": null,
          "effects": [],
          "unavailable_behavior": "hide"
        }
      ]
    },
    "soft_confidence_b3": {
      "node_id": "soft_confidence_b3",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "narration": "露西把手收回围裙边，指甲在布料上压出短短几道痕。楼下的声响沉下去，吧台这一侧只剩杯底碰木面的轻响。\n\n「屋里有只小铁盒，是莱特留下的。」\n\n「拿走它，别把我的名字带进去。」",
      "speaker_ref": "char_lucy",
      "location_ref": "scene_hibo_roadhouse",
      "on_enter_effects": [],
      "options": [
        {
          "option_id": "opt_soft_confidence_b3_continue",
          "text": "我记下了。",
          "target_node_id": "soft_confidence_b4",
          "condition": null,
          "effects": [],
          "unavailable_behavior": "hide"
        }
      ]
    },
    "soft_confidence_b4": {
      "node_id": "soft_confidence_b4",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "narration": "杯沿在露西指间转了半圈，水渍留在木面上。靠窗角落的报纸翻过一页，纸声很轻；楼下的低响隔着地板断续传来。\n\n「那只铁盒，我没开过。里面是什么，我不知道。」\n\n「莱特只说，东西放在那里，比放在我这儿干净。」",
      "speaker_ref": "char_lucy",
      "location_ref": "scene_hibo_roadhouse",
      "on_enter_effects": [],
      "options": [
        {
          "option_id": "opt_soft_confidence_b4_continue",
          "text": "他还说什么？",
          "target_node_id": "soft_confidence_b5",
          "condition": null,
          "effects": [],
          "unavailable_behavior": "hide"
        }
      ]
    },
    "soft_confidence_b5": {
      "node_id": "soft_confidence_b5",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "narration": "露西把杯子推到吧台内侧，手掌遮住自己的嘴角。她没有看窗边，只把视线落在你面前那道水痕上。\n\n「门上的钥匙，也许在雨桶底下。也许没有，我只听他说过一次。」\n\n「他最后来这里时，手上沾着黑粉，指缝里都是。」",
      "speaker_ref": "char_lucy",
      "location_ref": "scene_hibo_roadhouse",
      "on_enter_effects": [],
      "options": [
        {
          "option_id": "opt_soft_confidence_b5_continue",
          "text": "黑粉从哪来？",
          "target_node_id": "soft_confidence_b6",
          "condition": null,
          "effects": [],
          "unavailable_behavior": "hide"
        }
      ]
    },
    "soft_confidence_b6": {
      "node_id": "soft_confidence_b6",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "narration": "地板下方传来一阵闷笑，又很快压低。露西抬手把散落的发丝别到耳后，指尖停在耳边，像是在等那声音过去。\n\n「他没说黑粉从哪来，只说那间屋子怪。」\n\n「他说，外面量只有二十步宽，进里面量，却多出四步。」",
      "speaker_ref": "char_lucy",
      "location_ref": "scene_hibo_roadhouse",
      "on_enter_effects": [],
      "options": [
        {
          "option_id": "opt_soft_confidence_b6_continue",
          "text": "我记下了。",
          "target_node_id": "end_soft",
          "condition": null,
          "effects": [],
          "unavailable_behavior": "hide"
        }
      ]
    },
    "end_soft": {
      "node_id": "end_soft",
      "type": "end",
      "narration": "露西把擦杯布搭回手腕，转身去收邻桌的空盘，没有再看靠窗角落。你把纸条压进外套内袋，从吧台侧面退开；门轴轻响，冷风贴着地面灌进来。报纸翻动了一页，杯架上的玻璃轻轻碰在一起。酒馆的灯光留在身后，希博公路的夜色在门外铺开。\n\n「别回头看我。」露西低声说。\n\n「要是有人问，我今晚没跟你说过话。」",
      "speaker_ref": "char_lucy",
      "location_ref": "scene_hibo_roadhouse",
      "on_enter_effects": [],
      "options": []
    },
    "cash_arrangement_b1": {
      "node_id": "cash_arrangement_b1",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "narration": "靠窗角落的报纸翻过一页，纸声盖住吧台后的短暂空隙。露西没有看那边，只把空杯往你面前推了半寸，杯底压住一圈湿痕。\n\n「别在这里叫他的名字。希博公路北面，有间他用过的测绘屋；从大路上看不见。」\n\n「这不是交情，是把麻烦换个地方放。」",
      "speaker_ref": "char_lucy",
      "location_ref": "scene_hibo_roadhouse",
      "on_enter_effects": [],
      "options": [
        {
          "option_id": "opt_cash_arrangement_b1_continue",
